  "summary": "Shopify customerPaymentMethodRemoteCreate requires a payment method identifier as of 2026-07",
  "details": "As of Admin API version 2026-07, customerPaymentMethodRemoteCreate requires the gateway's payment method identifier: paymentMethodId for Stripe, customerPaymentProfileId for Authorize.net, paymentMethodToken for Braintree.\n\nSend the gateway's payment method identifier with every customerPaymentMethodRemoteCreate call before moving to 2026-07.",
